# Settings pages

Self-service and configuration hubs. Mirror **`src/features/profile/`**. Do not use `TablePageViewport` / list-page CRUD for these surfaces.

## Rules

- Hook → stateless page → thin route with **page scroll** (`overflow-y-auto`)
- Inline `DynamicForm` for primary edits; modals for secondary workflows
- Feature skeleton while `!loaded` — not `TableSkeleton`
- Profile / personal settings stay session-scoped; do not require `users:write`
- Future org/app settings get their own feature folder — do not dump into `users` or invent `[id]` detail routes

See `.docs/components/settings-pages.md`.
